    - "Pick grid size (H x W), 3 distinct colors for bg/obstacle/moving"
    - "Build a bottom-heavy obstacle floor profile — prefer high bottom-row coverage with mostly 1-3 cell obstacle columns; allow only occasional taller columns and rare sparse bottom-only post profiles"
