    - "Verify all output moving pixels are in free cells, each object cannot shift down further, and no output moving pixel is 8-adjacent to obstacle"
    - "For each object, choose a random upward shift (>= 1 for at least one object) such that the lifted object still fits in free cells and does not overlap blocked cells"
    - "Clear settled positions and stamp objects at lifted positions to get the input grid"
