  steps:
    1. Pick N=3 or 4 and chain orientation (H or V).
    2. For each consecutive pair, pick a shared edge-contact offset (0-4). Assign each block
       0, 1, or 2 connecting edges depending on position (endpoints get 1, interior get 2).
    3. Generate N 5x5 sprites on bg=7, each single-connected single-color, with exactly the
       required fg pixels touching chain-direction edges at designated offsets, and zero fg
